# Zones for test/Glibc.raz, which make compiles with zic -b slim: their
# tables stop at the last change of rule, and the footer says the rest.
# Test/Slim is New York's rules from 1967; Test/South a southern zone
# whose summer spans the new year.

Rule	Slim	1967	2006	-	Apr	lastSun	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	Slim	1967	2006	-	Oct	lastSun	2:00	0	S
Rule	Slim	2007	max	-	Mar	Sun>=8	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	Slim	2007	max	-	Nov	Sun>=1	2:00	0	S
Zone	Test/Slim	-4:56:02 -	LMT	1883 Nov 18 17:00u
			-5:00	Slim	E%sT

Rule	South	2008	max	-	Apr	Sun>=1	3:00	0	-
Rule	South	2008	max	-	Oct	Sun>=1	2:00	1:00	-
Zone	Test/South	10:00	-	+10	2008 Jun 1
			10:00	South	+10/+11
